  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b5dd8adc-ccdf-4129-b190-0be2d5aa4e60"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "draws one path from the bundle treated as a finite metric space in \
path-space.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"c6721dda-c1da-459e-b50a-e27721766737"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
